WEBVTT

00:06:28.353 --> 00:06:33.248
that's still kind of captured
by the efficiency myth,

00:06:33.272 --> 00:06:35.034
how do you start to change it?

00:06:36.011 --> 00:06:37.567
Try some experiments.

00:06:38.421 --> 00:06:39.787
In the Netherlands,

00:06:39.811 --> 00:06:44.525
home care nursing used to be run
pretty much like the supermarket:

00:06:44.549 --> 00:06:47.327
standardized and prescribed work

00:06:47.351 --> 00:06:49.119
to the minute:

00:06:49.143 --> 00:06:52.799
nine minutes on Monday,
seven minutes on Wednesday,

00:06:52.823 --> 00:06:54.537
eight minutes on Friday.

00:06:54.561 --> 00:06:56.943
The nurses hated it.

00:06:56.967 --> 00:06:59.339
So one of them, Jos de Blok,

00:06:59.363 --> 00:07:00.944
proposed an experiment.